WEBVTT

00:03:59.676 --> 00:04:01.476
They are bad news.

00:04:01.476 --> 00:04:02.636
There are many species;

00:04:02.676 --> 00:04:04.956
they become pesticide resistant;

00:04:04.956 --> 00:04:09.236
and they transmit hundreds
of plant viruses

00:04:09.236 --> 00:04:11.756
that cause cassava brown streak disease

00:04:11.796 --> 00:04:13.596
and cassava mosaic disease.

00:04:14.076 --> 00:04:16.196
This completely kills the plant.

00:04:17.036 --> 00:04:18.836
And if there's no cassava,

00:04:18.876 --> 00:04:22.876
there's no food or income
for millions of people.

00:04:24.156 --> 00:04:26.596
It took me one trip to Tanzania

00:04:26.636 --> 00:04:29.356
to realize that these women
need some help.

00:04:29.396 --> 00:04:33.636
These amazing, strong,
small-scale family farmers,